{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，儘管埃隆·馬斯克(Elon Musk)因利益衝突迴避了SpaceX與特斯拉之間的合併談判，但SpaceX周四表示，該公司與特斯拉的潛在合併交易需要獲得控股股東馬斯克的批准。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583524.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.842764+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:33:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"39c022da13cdce84b62d6c069863233362ec19d093dbf02a4bcc911fe46a78a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}